WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Step 1: Launching the Local RAG System using python rag.py.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The system starts running in the terminal.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: The system is ready to receive questions from the user.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 3: The user types a question into the terminal.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The Local RAG System processes the question and searches its knowledge base.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 4: The system generates and displays an answer in the terminal.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The Local RAG System successfully answers the user's question.